---
---

<section id="mashini" class="bg-paper py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8">
    <div class="reveal max-w-3xl">
      <p class="label">Машини</p>
      <h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl md:text-5xl">
        Точната машина за вашия обект.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Подбираме модела и асортимента според хората, пространството и ритъма на вашия обект.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-cream">
        <div class="flex h-56 items-center md:h-64 justify-center bg-ink p-8">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 220 180" class="h-full w-full max-w-[15rem]" role="img" aria-label="Стилизирана кафе машина">
            <rect x="42" y="6" width="136" height="168" rx="10" fill="#2a241e" />
            <rect x="55" y="18" width="110" height="56" rx="6" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <circle cx="78" cy="39" r="9" fill="#e8500a" opacity="0.9" />
            <circle cx="110" cy="39" r="9" fill="#e8500a" opacity="0.65" />
            <circle cx="142" cy="39" r="9" fill="#e8500a" opacity="0.42" />
            <rect x="68" y="88" width="84" height="51" rx="5" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <rect x="93" y="97" width="34" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#e8500a" />
            <path d="M94 113h32l-4 17H98l-4-17Z" fill="#faf6ed" opacity="0.22" />
            <rect x="62" y="149" width="96" height="10" rx="5" fill="#0f0c0a" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-7">
          <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
            Кафе
          </button>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Кафе автомат</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            Еспресо, капучино и шоколад от прясно смляно кафе — бързо и с постоянен вкус във всяка чаша.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 border-t border-ink/10 pt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink-soft">
            Капацитет: 500 чаши · Карта/монети
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-cream">
        <div class="flex h-56 items-center md:h-64 justify-center bg-ink p-8">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 220 180" class="h-full w-full max-w-[15rem]" role="img" aria-label="Стилизиран снакс автомат">
            <rect x="42" y="6" width="136" height="168" rx="10" fill="#2a241e" />
            <rect x="54" y="18" width="86" height="118" rx="6" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <g fill="#e8500a">
              <rect x="62" y="28" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.9" />
              <rect x="88" y="28" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.55" />
              <rect x="114" y="28" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.72" />
              <rect x="62" y="63" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.5" />
              <rect x="88" y="63" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.82" />
              <rect x="114" y="63" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.42" />
              <rect x="62" y="98" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.65" />
              <rect x="88" y="98" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.4" />
              <rect x="114" y="98" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.88" />
            </g>
            <rect x="149" y="18" width="17" height="65" rx="4" fill="#3a322a" />
            <circle cx="157.5" cy="95" r="7" fill="#e8500a" />
            <rect x="55" y="146" width="110" height="14" rx="5" fill="#0f0c0a" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-7">
          <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
            Снакс
          </button>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Снакс автомат</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            Закуски, вафли и свежи сандвичи на една ръка разстояние, с асортимент според вашия екип.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 border-t border-ink/10 pt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink-soft">
            Капацитет: 40 селекции · Карта/монети
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="reveal overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-ink/10 bg-cream">
        <div class="flex h-56 items-center md:h-64 justify-center bg-ink p-8">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 220 180" class="h-full w-full max-w-[15rem]" role="img" aria-label="Стилизиран комбиниран автомат">
            <rect x="31" y="6" width="158" height="168" rx="10" fill="#2a241e" />
            <rect x="43" y="18" width="81" height="112" rx="6" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <g fill="#e8500a">
              <rect x="51" y="27" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.88" />
              <rect x="77" y="27" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.55" />
              <rect x="103" y="27" width="13" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.72" />
              <rect x="51" y="61" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.46" />
              <rect x="77" y="61" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.82" />
              <rect x="103" y="61" width="13" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.42" />
              <rect x="51" y="95" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.68" />
              <rect x="77" y="95" width="19" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.4" />
              <rect x="103" y="95" width="13" height="25" rx="3" opacity="0.9" />
            </g>
            <rect x="135" y="18" width="42" height="54" rx="6" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <circle cx="156" cy="38" r="9" fill="#e8500a" />
            <rect x="144" y="82" width="24" height="48" rx="5" fill="#0f0c0a" />
            <rect x="148" y="91" width="16" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#e8500a" opacity="0.75" />
            <rect x="43" y="143" width="134" height="17" rx="5" fill="#0f0c0a" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-7">
          <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
            Комбиниран
          </button>
          <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold">Комбиниран автомат</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            Напитки и закуски в една компактна машина — практично решение за обекти с ограничено място.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 border-t border-ink/10 pt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink-soft">
            Капацитет: 36 селекции · Карта/монети
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
